ees complex connections, excellent spatial vision, very good leadership qualities, but is unfriendly, eats unhealthily, regarded as show\u2011off, not open to new ideas. D responds to unexpected events adequately, can concentrate very well, solves problems extremely well, takes responsibility seriously, considered moody, regarded as a loner.\n\nAlso reference A's strengths: quick correct decisions, calm in crisis, excellent attention, positive crew atmosphere, altruistic.\n\nThus final vote: Candidate A.\n\nNow produce output."}
